Cypress oil offers a fresh, woody, and resinous scent, often described as dry, green, and slightly spicy. It evokes clean, invigorating forest air with distinct pine and cedar nuances, providing a sophisticated, natural character.   

Primarily a top/middle note, cypress adds structure, lift, and natural freshness to blends. It excels in masculine, fougère, woody, and citrus compositions, harmonising well with diverse ingredients like woods, herbs, and spices.

